 "inference": [
  "Melee damage is not stored per weapon. One shared affector holds four entries and the graph picks one: entry 1 (60) for melee weapon ID 2, entry 0 (35) for every other ID. Weapon ID 2 is therefore the Sledgehammer, by the loadout-screen values.",
  "Entry 3 (70) is selected when a soldier state variable compares true against 2. The variable resolves to the name HallucinationLevel by index; that name and the direction of the comparison are not confirmed.",
  "Entry 2 (1500) is the takedown kill, applied to the victim with a parameter of 0.2 (probably a delay in seconds).",
  "The EOD Bot Arm is not weapon ID 2 if it deals 35 as the loadout screen shows; its separate 0.15 firing value (L4013) is not used by this graph.",
  "Melee reach in this graph is 1.65, or 2.55 in a pitch-dependent case."
 ],
